     [38;5;246mIn-memory UUID per page load / per process start. Reconstructs a session's sequence; no persistent identifier, no [39m
     [38;5;246mconsent surface.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Persistent device ID
     [38;5;246mUUID in localStorage, survives reloads. Reveals recurring per-user failures; creates a tracking identifier with [39m
     [38;5;246mconsent and retention obligations.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m No correlation ID
     [38;5;246mRecords stand alone. Simplest, but concurrent users' records can't be untangled into sequences.[39m
